WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
The reason why I became a 
threat to the&nbsp;system,

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.680
not because of any actual physical

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.056
power that I have,

00:00:07.056 --> 00:00:09.546
but because courage is&nbsp;contagious.

00:00:11.013 --> 00:00:14.843
And any act of speaking 
the truth can cause 

00:00:14.843 --> 00:00:18.922
incalculable transformations in&nbsp;
social consciousness.

00:00:18.922 --> 00:00:20.979
And we all have this power.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.579
It's a moral act to use this power.

00:00:27.497 --> 00:00:31.439
You may or&nbsp;may not achieve 
the results that you wanted,

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.792
but there is eternal beauty in

00:00:37.609 --> 00:00:39.756
trying&nbsp;to find truth,

00:00:39.756 --> 00:00:48.361
in risking everything you've 
got for what's right!

